    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de771ab82d9d5a0bd20ae54a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇在闪耀系列赛中最初的三年里，\n如飞龙般大放异彩──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c012a0241d1b16ef4048518707ffd014869bb7ddcce676f323d1ba6c010820e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc0e5cdf7e17df596febb876",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这只不过是开端而已，\n她后来还接连打破沙土的日本纪录──",
